              "value": "Whenever a terra-cotta squadron Strides, the garrison first Forms Up as a free action to condense into a 20-foot-by-20-foot area (minus any missing squares), then moves up to its Speed. This works just like a Gargantuan creature moving; for instance, if any square of the squadron enters 3, the extra movement cost applies to the whole squadron."
